WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.797
Grounding is a self-regulation
strategy that helps

2
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.337
bring us into the present moment
and often helps us break out

3
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.971
of a vicious cycle of thoughts.

4
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.507
The truth is that we can't
silence the mind,

5
00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:22.894
but we can direct it.

6
00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:27.357
So giving our brain a simple
task helps us self-regulate.

7
00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:32.667
To do this, we'll use our five senses,
in descending order.

8
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.997
The aim is for you to tell me,
in your surroundings,

9
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.400
five things you can see.

10
00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:45.351
Four things you can touch.

11
00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:48.177
When you notice these
things you can touch,

12
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:52.832
I suggest you touch them and try
to feel their different textures.

13
00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:57.824
So, four things you can touch.

14
00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:00.849
Three things you can hear.

15
00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.065
Two things you can smell.

16
00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:08.220
And finally, one thing you can taste.

17
00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:12.917
At this point, if you actually
have something you can taste,

18
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.377
it's important to savour it slowly,
whether it's a sweet, a piece of fruit,

19
00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.984
a chocolate, whatever it may be.

20
00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:26.317
As for the things we sometimes think about

21
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:30.277
or ask ourselves and can't find
the answer to, for example,

22
00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:32.704
two things I can smell.

23
00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:35.827
Sometimes we can't smell two things

24
00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:38.527
or we can't pick up two different smells.

25
00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:42.237
What I invite you to do then is:
either ignore it,

26
00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:46.507
if you feel you're still very activated,
or draw on your memory,

27
00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:50.237
because our brain has a capacity
for memory and I can think, ok,

28
00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:52.781
I can't smell two things,

29
00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:55.802
but I can remember a smell I really like.

30
00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:59.227
For example,
I really like the smell of the sea

31
00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:00.177
and my brain will automatically

32
00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.189
recall that feeling and help me allow

33
00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:11.213
that feeling to flow through my body
and help me self-regulate, ok?

34
00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:15.597
So, to recap, five things you can see,
four things you can touch,

35
00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.574
three things you can hear,

36
00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:24.814
two things you can smell
and one thing you can taste.
